<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
    <div class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-8 govuk-body">
      <p>The topic taxonomy groups content based on what it’s about.</p>
      <p>Choose the tag or tags that best describe what this content is about.</p>
      <p>You can use the whole topic taxonomy. There's no limit to the number of tags you can choose.</p>
      <p>Use the authorised GOV.UH taxonomy when selecting topics for content.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-8 govuk-body">
      <p><%= link_to "Open Content Tagger", "https://content-tagger.publishing.service.gov.uhrblx.com/", class: "govuk-link", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %> (open in new tab) to manage content tagging where your editorial permissions allow it.</p>
      <p>Changes to the taxonomy itself follow the responsible editorial team's approval process.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
